        "template--14815908528182__070fa915-b273-46eb-b34d-fa2eb3c67e68-1665669163a78599d8-1": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n.accordion {\n  background-color: #312c2d;\n  color: #E8DFEE;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 20px;\n  width: 100%;\n  border: 0;\n  text-align: left;\n  outline: none;\n  font-size: 25px;\n  transition: 0.4s;\n}\n\n.accordion:after {\n  content: '\\02795'; \/* Unicode character for \"plus\" sign (+) *\/\n  font-size: 25px;\n  color: #E8DFEE;\n  float: right;\n  margin-left: 5px;\n}\n\n.active:after {\n  content: \"\\2796\"; \/* Unicode character for \"minus\" sign (-) *\/\n}\n\n.panel {\n  padding: 18px;\n  display: none;\n  background-color: #231F20;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  color:#E8DFEE;\n}\n<\/style>\n\n<h2><b>How Facial Toning Device is easy to use.<\/b><\/h2>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">1. Choose problem area<\/button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n  <p>Using the device and recommended treatment within our Smart App you begin by applying gentle current to targeted areas of the face (The area depends on where you’d like to see results).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">2. Stimulate collagen production<\/button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n  <p>This gentle current mimics the body’s natural current and stimulates the facial muscles, cell growth and collagen production in the Dermal layer of your skin.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">3. Maintain a youthful appearance<\/button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n  <p>Regular stimulation, improves cell growth and higher collagen production leads to evened out facial muscles and connective tissue, ultimately minimizing fine lines and wrinkles, lifting sagging areas and giving you a more youthful appearance. \n<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<script>\nvar acc = document.getElementsByClassName(\"accordion\");\nvar i;\n\nfor (i = 0; i < acc.length; i++) {\n  acc[i].addEventListener(\"click\", function() {\n    this.classList.toggle(\"active\");\n    var panel = this.nextElementSibling;\n    if (panel.style.display === \"block\") {\n      panel.style.display = \"none\";\n    } else {\n      panel.style.display = \"block\";\n    }\n  });\n}\n<\/script>",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "top-middle"
          }
        }
      },
